OL,3,GNEWSACharity sea swim cancelled over
OL,4,Aforecast wind
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn annual charity sea swim has been
OL,7,Fcancelled amid concerns about predicted
OL,8,Fgusting winds and strong swells.
OL,10,FLyme Splash sees up to 300 participants
OL,11,Fswim two miles (3.2km) in open water
OL,12,Fbetween Lyme Regis and Charmouth in
OL,13,FDorset.
OL,15,FThe RNLI, which took over the running
OL,16,Fof the event this year, said it had
OL,17,Ftaken the decision to cancel Sunday's
OL,18,Fevent on safety grounds.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
