OL,3,GNEWSACharity sea swim cancelled over
OL,4,Aforecast wind
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the mixed long-term forecast
OL,7,Fmeant it would not be rescheduling and
OL,8,Fswimmers could either defer their entry
OL,9,Funtil 2027, request a refund or donate
OL,10,Ftheir entry fee to the RNLI.
